  "sourceText": "Irish Dream\nBy: Carrie Barr\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 3:12pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ounce Hazelnut Liqueur\n1 ounce Irish Cream Liqueur\n1 ounce Creme de Cacao (brown)\n4 ounces Vanilla Ice Cream\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend ingredients with ice until smooth and pour into frosted pilsner glass. 2 Top with whipped cream and chocolate sprinkles.",
